'''Fragile''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting the [[Fragile Egg]], the [[Tech Egg]], and the [[JD Egg]] during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is beige in color with a fragile cardboard-like texture, hence the name. In the center of the blade is a fluted piece of cardboard, which is held together by brown tape and a red sticker that has a cracked knife imprinted on it. The guard is beige like the blade, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia==
*It has a [[Fragile (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*All the eggs needed to collect this knife are [[:Category:Common|common]] in rarity.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

